Devflow skills

The Devflow skills, reviewer personas and findings schema built into devpit
come with devflow-engine, whose text is adapted from the sources below. Their
evals follow the pattern of anthropics/skills' skill-creator.

  devflow-briefing      grilling, grill-me; interview-me
  devflow-context       to-spec, domain-modeling; spec-driven-development
  devflow-plan          to-tickets; planning-and-task-breakdown
  devflow-execution     tdd, diagnosing-bugs; test-driven-development,
                        incremental-implementation
  devflow-review        code-review; code-review-and-quality,
                        security-and-hardening; requesting-code-review
  devflow-completion    handoff; verification-before-completion
  devflow-setup         devpit's own
  devflow-spec          agents/code-reviewer; code-review
  devflow-standards     agents/code-reviewer; code-review
  devflow-security      agents/security-auditor; security-and-hardening

